{"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"rejectionReports"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AsyncQueue","preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV","identifier":"doc:\/\/AsyncQueues\/documentation\/AsyncQueues\/AsyncQueue"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"RejectionReport","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers15RejectionReportV","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/RejectionReport"},{"kind":"text","text":"> { "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"get"},{"kind":"text","text":" }"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The tracker’s worker checks each event’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"constraintViolation()"},{"type":"text","text":" before anything else, so a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rejected event is never enriched, held by a consent, written to a store or delivered. A"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"record a store recovered is checked too, and one rejected is forgotten by the store. In"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"debug builds each rejection is also logged at error level."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Reports wait until they are read, merged: a rejection joins the waiting report of the same","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"event, property and keyword, adding to its count and widening its timestamps. So the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reports waiting unread are at most one per constraint the app declares, however many events","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"break them. Copies of a tracker share one sequence, which ends once the tracker has","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"finished and every report has been read. A ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/noOp","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" tracker’s is empty.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"One task reads the reports at a time. The first iterator to read holds them until its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"iteration ends or it is released; a second reader meanwhile waits its turn, logging a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"warning once, then reads on from the next report, so the first gets every report in order."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A reader cancelled while it waits returns "},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker"]]},"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/rejectionreports"]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/rejectionReports"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A report of each event the tracker rejected because a property broke a constraint declared"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"on it, in the order the rejections happen."}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Trackers"}],"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"rejectionReports","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncQueue","preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"RejectionReport","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers15RejectionReportV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"Tracker.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Trackers\/Tracker.swift#L364"},"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Property","symbolKind":"property","title":"rejectionReports","externalID":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV16rejectionReports11AsyncQueues0E5QueueVyAA15RejectionReportVGvp"},"references":{"doc://AsyncQueues/documentation/AsyncQueues/AsyncQueue":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AsyncQueues\/documentation\/AsyncQueues\/AsyncQueue","title":"AsyncQueue","type":"topic","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"AsyncQueue","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/asyncqueues\/asyncqueue","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncQueue","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The reports or deliveries a library type makes, in the order it makes them, kept until they"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are read; one reader at a time reads them."}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker":{"title":"Tracker","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Tracker","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Tracker","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"What app code tracks events with: it records each event, with the time, the caller’s source"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"location and the task’s context, as one of its "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker/noOp":{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A tracker that drops every event, logging each one at debug level. Its "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"empty."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/noOp","title":"noOp","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"noOp"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Tracker","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV"}],"url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/noop","role":"symbol"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/RejectionReport":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Events a tracker rejected because a property broke a constraint declared on it: the event’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"name, the property and the keyword it broke, how many were rejected and when they were tracked."}],"title":"RejectionReport","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"RejectionReport","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/RejectionReport","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"RejectionReport","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/rejectionreport"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker/records-swift.property":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/records-swift.property","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"records"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV","text":"Tracker"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV7RecordsV","text":"Records"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The records of the events this tracker tracks, for a deliv